SUMMARY:ROSTAFA & Co. Presents: 2Pac Revisited
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a panel discussion on the life\, artistry and 
 Montclair connection of Tupac Amaru Shakur. Presented by ROSTAFA and 
 Company.\n\nFeaturing:\n\nMichael Eric Dyson - Professor\, commentator and 
 2Pac biographer.\nHafiz Farid - Award-winning writer\, director and 
 producer\nROSTAFA - actor\, musician\, event producer\n\nThe event will be 
 followed by a poetry session (6 p.m.) and concert (7 p.m.) at Montclair 
 Brewery.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
