DESCRIPTION:Come hang out with the SLAM E-Board and get involved in shapin
 g our events for the semester! Our Bi-Weekly General Body Meetings are a 
 space for students to learn about upcoming programs\, share ideas\, and h
 elp plan and execute events that bring the campus together. Whether you’r
 e interested in event planning\, marketing\, logistics\, or just want you
 r voice heard\, this is the place to be. We’ll be discussing what’s ahead
  for the semester\, ways to get involved\, and how you can make a real im
 pact through SLAM. No experience is needed—just bring your ideas\, energy
 \, and excitement to collaborate with us!\n\nHosted by: Student Life At M
 ontclair (SLAM)\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montcl
 air.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12607077
