SUMMARY:Cricut - Autumn Paper Lanterns
DESCRIPTION:\n\nWe are assembling two autumn-themed paper lanterns or 
 tea-light holders.  The vellum and cardstock is cut on the Cricut 
 machine.\n\nThe tall lantern has a sunflower design and the small one is 
 leaves and acorns.  Battery-operated tea lights give off a warm 
 glow.\n\nAll supplies are provided.  No Cricut machine or experience 
 necessary.\n\nOnline registration is required and limited to 24 Nutley 
 adults.\n\n \n\n
