 ibrary "shortcuts"\n\nRegister Here: https://montclair.libcal.com/calenda
 r/workshops/sprague-libr\n\nHosted by: Sprague Library\n\nOnline Location
 : https://montclair.libcal.com/calendar/workshops/sprague-libr\n\nAdditio
 nal Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/
 event/12568216
