UID:10141280-1789558200-1789561800@montclairlocal.news
SUMMARY:NJSave Information Session
DESCRIPTION:On September 16 from 11:30am – 12:30am\, the Office of Assemblywoman Bagolie and Lifelong Montclair will be holding an NJSave Information Session at the Wally Choice Community Center\, located at 45 Maple ave in Montclair. \nAt the event\, they will be hosting a speaker from the Division of Aging Services to explain how to apply for the NJSave program and the benefits that it can provide. The speaker will also discuss other work done by the Division of Aging Services and county offices focused on senior services across the state. \nA flyer has been attached for further information about this event. If you are interested in attending\, please fill out the following form to register: https://schedulesplus.com/montclair/kiosk/dspevent.do?event_id=482948&detail_id=6602082&filterschedule_id=&dt=2026-09-01 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/njsave-information-session/
LOCATION:Glenfield Park Wally Choice Community Center\, 49 Maple Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Montclair-9.16-NJSave-Flyer-2.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Office of Assemblywoman Rosy Bagolie":MAILTO:aswbagolie@njleg.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Unioncong": "https://www.unioncong.org/event/union-sages-guild-room/2026-09-16/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:unioncong
X-SOURCE:Union Congregational Church
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T140000
DTSTAMP:20260913T003319
CREATED:20260721T140937Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260721T140949Z
UID:10004545-1789560000-1789567200@www.unioncong.org
SUMMARY:Union Sages (Guild Room)
DESCRIPTION:Twice a month in the Guild Room\, usually the first and third Wednesday at noon. \nSages is a group of older members and friends that meet twice a month for a brown bag lunch and informal discussion of questions and issues that are relevant in that stage of their lives. The purpose of the group is to build community and support by providing a forum for discussion and gathering as a community.
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/union-sages-guild-room/2026-09-16/
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Featured Events,Small Groups
END:VEVENT
