DESCRIPTION:Omega Phi Chi Multicultural Sorority\, Inc.  invites students 
 to participate in an educational program focused on understanding and add
 ressing microaggressions. The event will feature an interactive presentat
 ion led by the Office of Advocacy and Outreach\, providing students with 
 the knowledge and tools to recognize microaggressions\, respond effective
 ly\, and advocate for themselves and others.\nFollowing the presentation\
 , executive members from various registered student organizations—includi
 ng the Black Student Union (BSU)\, LadiesFirst\, Latin American Student O
 rganization (LASO)\, Dominican Student Organization (DSO)\, and other mul
 ticultural organizations—will participate in a panel discussion\, sharing
  their lived experiences\, perspectives\, and advice for fostering a more
  inclusive campus community.\n\nHosted by: Omega Phi Chi\n\nAdditional In
 formation can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/
 12733776
