DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun and interactive Polish Bingo Night celebrati
 ng Polish culture\, language\, and community! Instead of traditional numb
 ers\, this bingo will feature Polish words\, symbols\, traditions\, and f
 un facts related to Poland. Participants will learn more about Polish cul
 ture while enjoying friendly competition\, laughter\, and prizes.\nNo pri
 or knowledge of Polish is required—everything will be explained\, making 
 this event welcoming for everyone. Bring your friends\, test your luck\, 
 and enjoy a night filled with culture\, excitement\, and community spirit
 !\n\nHosted by: Montclair State Polish Club\n\nAdditional Information can
  be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12713882
