DESCRIPTION:Join us to plant your own herbs with no gardening experience n
 eeded! We’ll be upcycling old jars\, and you’ll get to take home a plant 
 that you can continue caring for. Discover simple ways to reduce\, reuse\
 , and recycle while making more sustainable choices. Your herb is perfect
  for taking a break from classes and enjoying growing something new! \nNo
 te: We encourage you to bring an old glass jar you have from home you wan
 t to decorate and upcycle into a new home for your herb! If you don't hav
 e extra mason jars\, you can get creative and bring something like a yogu
 rt cup or a pickle jar. But don't worry\, if you don't have any available
  to you or forget\, we will have jars on hand.\nHow do I sign up?\nRSVP h
 ere in our Google Form:\nhttps://forms.gle/m2fTRyuBAHUMssyY6\nWhere and w
 hen?\n\n\nSeptember 23\, 2026\n\n\n3:45 PM - 5:00 PM\n\n\nStudent Center 
