 nse of adventure!\n \nPotential Hazards: Unpredictable weather changes\, 
 sunburn/heat exhaustion\, dehydration\, allergic reactions/poisonous plan
 ts\, insect bites\, and injury by running\, including sprains\, laceratio
 ns\, abrasions and fractures.\n \n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAddit
 ional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engag
