BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Thespaceforart": "https://thespaceforart.com/event/sonic-healing-experience-with-taylor-grant/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:thespaceforart
X-SOURCE:The Space For Art
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T203000
DTSTAMP:20260908T030639Z
CREATED:20260821T015723Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260908T030639Z
UID:10145-1790449200-1790454600@thespaceforart.com
SUMMARY:Sonic Sound Healing Experience with @RightontimeTay
DESCRIPTION:Sonic Sound Healing Experience with @RightontimeTay\nSaturday\, September 26 · 7:00 – 8:30 PM \nJoin us for a sonic healing journey with local DJ @RightontimeTay\, who blends crystal bowls with intentionally chosen tracks to restore the body to resonance. Picture the lights dimmed low\, the room falling away\, and nothing left but sound — waves of tone rippling across your skin\, low frequencies humming in your chest\, crystal bowls ringing out long after they’ve been struck. Taylor curates sound journeys of all kinds\, and this one is designed to let you fully rest: a ride through nostalgia\, exploration\, and fantasia\, carried by tone and texture rather than words. \nWe’re timing this with the full moon\, harnessing that energy as part of the experience. In sound healing traditions\, the full moon marks the peak of the lunar cycle — the moment everything you’ve been carrying rises to the surface and is ready to be released. It’s a night for letting go of what’s grown stagnant\, for clarity to surface\, for whatever you’ve been holding onto to finally move. The bowls and tones do the work of loosening it; the moon does the work of amplifying it. \nYou’ll spend the evening lying on the floor\, eyes closed\, letting the sound wash over and through you — no tension\, no talking\, just full-body immersion in the wave\, released a little further with every tone. \nCome with an open mind. Bring a yoga mat (or something soft to lie on) and a water bottle to stay hydrated — sound baths can pull you deep\, and you’ll want to come back out nourished. Beyond that\, you have nowhere else to be but to be! \nPlease give yourself enough time to park and arrive before 7pm. \nAfter the sound journey\, stay for The Unwind\, community dance party! \nTaylor will keep the vibes coming for us after the sound journey with gentle tunes that will get our bodies moving.  Your ticket for the sound healing gets you into the dance party\, but you can also invite friends and family to join you for the dance portion.  $10 tickets are sold separately for those not attending the sound healing\, and can be purchased here. \nScreenshot\nScreenshot\nScreenshot
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/sonic-healing-experience-with-taylor-grant/
LOCATION:the Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042
CATEGORIES:Art,Meditation,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_6294-e1788833234335.jpeg
END:VEVENT
