BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Thespaceforart": "https://thespaceforart.com/event/the-unwind-post-sound-healing-dance-party-with-rightontimetay/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:thespaceforart
X-SOURCE:The Space For Art
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T223000
DTSTAMP:20260908T030402Z
CREATED:20260908T030102Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260908T030402Z
UID:10320-1790456400-1790461800@thespaceforart.com
SUMMARY:The Unwind - Post Sound Healing Dance Party with @RightontimeTay
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, September 26 · 9:00 PM · $10 \nFollowing the Sonic Sound Healing that starts at 7pm.  Tickets for that are sold here. \nAfter the sound bath winds down\, the night doesn’t have to end — it just changes shape. Come dance it out at The Unwind\, a low-pressure\, all-are-welcome dance session for anyone who wants to keep moving after the bowls go quiet. \nThis isn’t a club night. There’s no social pressure\, set choreography\, or a “right” way to move. Think soft lighting\, a thoughtfully built playlist\, and a room full of people swaying\, stepping\, and shaking loose whatever the sound healing stirred up. Come as you are — sweatpants\, bare feet\, eyes closed if you want them closed. Dance alone\, dance with a stranger\, or just sway in place. All bodies\, all skill levels\, all moods welcome. \nIt’s the perfect way to integrate a sound healing session\, moving what’s been released\, letting it settle into the body through motion instead of stillness. And if you’re just joining us for The Unwind on its own\, that’s welcome too. \nBring water\, bring comfortable shoes (or none at all)\, and bring whatever energy you’ve got. We’ll do the rest. \n\n\n\nScreenshot
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/the-unwind-post-sound-healing-dance-party-with-rightontimetay/
LOCATION:the Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042
CATEGORIES:Music,The Space for Wellness,Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_6294-e1788833234335.jpeg
END:VEVENT
