 Age" line.\n\nYour little one is growing up fast.\n\nBuilding on the 
 foundation set in Little Seeds\, your toddler will engage in weekly 
 activities that encourage language development\, body awareness\, sharing 
 and social interactions\, and following directions. For children aged 2\, 
 with a caregiver. Glen Ridge residents only. \n\nRegistration is required 
 and is limited to Glen Ridge residents. Only one adult may accompany a 
 child. Thank you for your cooperation.
