SUMMARY:Parkinson’s Strength
DESCRIPTION:Strength and flexibility exercises to manage Parkinson’s symptoms using free weights and resistance. Seated and standing options are available with a support bar. Strengthen\, tone\, and improve Flexibility.\n  \nFree for JCC members / $5 per class for non-members\nLocation: Studio 2\nInstructor: Lorena Telias \nCall 973-530-3407 for inquiries or to register.
