DESCRIPTION:**Young Family Hike &amp\; Scavenger Hunt**   \nJoin other you
 ng Shomrei families for a fun scavenger hunt and an easy\, guided nature h
 ike led by a Naturalist from the Cora Hartshorn Arboretum!  \n  \n**Arriva
 l Time:** Please arrive by 10:15am so the program can start promptly at 10
 :30am.  \n  \n**What to Bring:** Bagged lunch\, snacks\, and cold drinks f
 or your family  \n  \n**Location**  \nCora Hartshorn Arboretum &amp\; Bird
  Sanctuary  \n324 Forest Drive South  \nShort Hills\, NJ 07078  \ndirectio
 ns: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Cora+Hartshorn+Arboretum+and+Bird+Sa
 nctuary/@40.7247647\,-74.330895\,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89c3ae89e0f
 f8ab3:0xb6007badb05602f8!8m2!3d40.7247647!4d-74.3283201!16zL20vMDloYjhj!5m
 1!1e1?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D  \n  \n**RSVP Re
 quired by October 2nd**  \nLink TBA\, please check back  \n  \nQuestions?*
 * Contact the Shomrei Office  \noffice@shomrei.org  \n(973) 746-5031 ext. 
 0\n\n
