UID:tribe-18394@montclairfoundation.org
DESCRIPTION:Creating with Nature: Journal MakingWednesday\, October 14\,6:
 00-7:00 PMSlow down and reconnect with yourself through creative memory-ke
 eping. Craft your own rustic journal\, then enjoy a guided garden stroll u
 sing simple sketch-noting and snippet-journaling to capture the day’s me
 mories and hidden treasures you find.Fee: Individual Class: $12 Members / 
 $17 General PublicPre Registration is required. There are no drop-ins for 
