SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260911T204122Z
DESCRIPTION:**An Afternoon of Klezmer**  \nJoin us for a Sunday afternoon 
 of listening\, dancing\, and rejoicing with the Isle of Klezbos\, the accl
 aimed all-female klezmer ensemble. Described by New York Magazine as “cu
 tting-edge Klezmer\," this powerhouse sextet brings a beautiful balance of
  tradition and modern flair. Their music spans an incredible variety of st
 yles from neo-traditional folk dance and Yiddish swing to unexpected rhyth
 ms like reggae\, retro tango\, and Latin grooves.  \n**Sun\, Nov 8\, 2026\
 , 4:00pm**\n\n- $20 in Advance\n- $25 at the Door\n- Under 18 &amp\; Stude
 nts with ID\, Free\n\n**Purchase Tickets Here:** (link to come)  \n  \n***
 Sponsored by the Eric Singer Charitable Fund and Congregation Shomrei Emun
 ah***\n\n\\#ejcc\n\n
LOCATION:Social Hall
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL;VALUE=URI:https://teamup.com/kstx8swyw669kakgqa/events/2167281732
X-SOURCE:Congregation Shomrei Emunah
X-TEAMUP-ROOM:Social Hall
END:VEVENT
