SUMMARY:Chess Class - Grades 1-9
DESCRIPTION:Learn to play and strategize chess. All levels of experience 
 welcome. Grades 1-9. \n\nPLEASE REGISTER YOUR CHILD'S NAME NOT THE 
 PARENT/CAREGIVER.\n\nThis one hour class meets September 8\, 15\, 22\, 29\, 
 October 6\, 13\, 20\, 27 and November 3\, 10\, 17 and 24.\n\nPlease plan on 
 attending all classes. Glen Ridge residents only.\n\nChildren under the age 
 of 8 must be accompanied by an adult at all times.
