 aura Benanti\, alongside an exciting ensemble of theatrical talent. Create
 d by Ferris Jones\, The Precipice is an original musical exploring sisterh
 ood\, identity\, and the wildness we carry within us.$45 MEMBER ADMISSION 
 | $
