DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261206T100000
DTSTAMP:20260913T043256Z
UID:51ttjtrfvvif8egqvlags11h3u_R20240908T130000@google.com__20261206
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20221110T035625Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>Our</span><b><b> Choir sings most Sundays </b></b><span>
 during the 10am service.</span><i><i>  Are you a singer?  Do you like to
  sing? <span> </span></i></i><span>Consider joining us for<span> </span>
 </span><b><b>rehearsal on Sundays at 9am </b></b><span>led by our<span> <
 /span></span><b><b>Music Director Ema Mitrovi</b></b><span><b><b>ć</b></
 b>.  If you have any questions\, speak with Ema (<a href="mailto:music@ho
