SUMMARY:Heavenly Finds Thrift Shop Open
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261207T140000
DTSTAMP:20260913T043256Z
UID:1d4u65gk345oni364nbumtdvdt@google.com__20261207
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260804T151009Z
DESCRIPTION:<span><span>The Heavenly Finds Thrift Shop\, located in Living
 ston\, is open<span> </span></span><b><b>most Mondays (as of September 20
 26) from 10 am - 2 pm</b></b><span>. Proceeds from the thrift shop are use
 d to support many local organizations\, including those that focus on food
  insecurity and youth services. Donations are accepted any time except Mon
 day afternoons and Tuesday mornings. For more information please visit <
